# Ignore all result/config JSON across AFlex_bench — benchmark runs generate
# large amounts of per-run result JSON, summaries and sweep outputs that must
# not pollute git. Source code (*.py / *.sh) and writeups (*.md) stay tracked.
*.json

# Ignore loose profiling TXT in retrain/data root (tracked sets live in subdirs)
**/energy_model/data/*.txt
**/retrain/data/*.txt
# Tracked energy model training data (git-managed, self-contained sets):
#   retrain/data/v1_layer_profile/
#   retrain/data/v2_pipeline_profile/
